--- !u!114 &291108373
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 57387907}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Hey you, boy! Don't listen to what the rest say about me! I'm not crazy!
  - '& 1: Who says you''re crazy? 2: I don''t think you''re crazy sir.'
  - Everyone! All because I know the landlord is hiding a secret.
  - '1: The truth? 2: Items? ^'
  - T-thanks... at least there's someone in the village that likes me...
  - "^ 1: Why don\u2019t the others like you? 2: We can be friends if you want."
  branch1:
  - Thuong Luong never acted like this before. Something malicious is afoot, I just
    know it!
  branch2:
  - Yes! Those blasted rogue items carry a spiritual presence. The farmer has one
    in his very home, can you believe it!?
  branch3:
  - "The Farmer and Woodsculptor like me... all the rest don\u2019t because of how
    outspoken I am about things."
  branch4:
  - "Sure, kid, that\u2019d be great."
  skipNum: 3
