      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0]
      value: Hey friend, you gotta come to class! C'mon, I'll take you there!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3219861141300770686, guid: fd272405362130848a1b5e3d86ed6948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1]
      value: '& 1: Class? What Class? 2: Who are you?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3219861141300770686, guid: fd272405362130848a1b5e3d86ed6948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2]
      value: What're you talking about? We all go to class every day.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3219861141300770686, guid: fd272405362130848a1b5e3d86ed6948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: Let's go! We'll be late. &
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3219861141300770686, guid: fd272405362130848a1b5e3d86ed6948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: I'm your new friend, of course! Now let's go!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3219861141300770686, guid: fd272405362130848a1b5e3d86ed6948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5]
