--- !u!114 &844135876
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 375585886}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Oi, kiddo, How are ya? Lookin' for something to buy?
  - '& 1: How is business? 2: What do you have?'
  - "It ain\u2019t too good, I'm afraid. Not all too many customers these days, you
    see."
  - '1: Do you have any spiritual items? 2: Why no customers? ^'
  - All sorts of things! Err- well, not really. Supply has been low ever since the
    boat was lost.
  - "^ 1: I\u2019ll go in and take a look if that\u2019s okay. 2: Do you sell food?"
  branch1:
  - "Hmm, maybe somewhere. If you find any, just take it. I don\u2019t need that
    kind of karma\u2026"
  branch2:
  - "Storms have been bad, kid, surely you\u2019ve noticed? Lots of folk losing their
    lives..."
  branch3:
  - By all means! See if you can find something.
  branch4:
  - Used to. Ever since the famines started, ya know. The farmer will tell you how
    bad it really is. Man, I feel bad for him.
  skipNum: 3
