--- !u!114 &1200651769
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1193301193}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "Hello, child. What is it you\u2019re doing here?"
  - '& 1: Tell me more about the village. 2: What do you do here in the village?'
  - The great Wyrm Thuong Luong rampages. Storms have been beating down upon the
    village for months innumerable.
  - '1: The people seem scared. 2: Why is this happening? ^'
  - "I am the village\u2019s shaman. I commune with spirits and gods, representing
    our village\u2019s people."
  - "^ 1: Have you communed with them to help the village? 2: You seem like you\u2019re
    doing a poor job of it."
  branch1:
  - Smaller wyrms have been sent to the village too. The people fear for their lives.
  branch2:
  - I... know not. Only that Thuong Luong behaves strangely. It was never this aggressive
    before.
  branch3:
  - I am... unable to. Even if I could, they would not be willing to hear me.
  branch4:
  - Rude! If you had lost a child as I have, perhaps your focus would be clouded
    as well.
  skipNum: 3
