--- !u!114 &1208709802
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1208709801}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "Hey there sonny! Haven\u2019t seen you around before."
  - '& 1: Strange... good to meet you, though. 2: How goes the farm?'
  - Yeah, good to meet you! Anyway, what do you need, sonny?
  - '1: Seen any magical objects? 2: What happened to the village? ^'
  - "Not too well, I\u2019m sorry to say. The famines are over now, but the effects
    are still tremendous."
  - '^ 1: How is the village feeling? 2: Is there anything you can do?'
  branch1:
  - "I\u2019m unsure what you mean by magical, but I know the landlord has that Straw
    Hat.  It used to belong to a child..."
  branch2:
  - "Storms have been raging here for so long now. That and the business with the
    Shaman years ago... we still haven\u2019t recovered."
  branch3:
  - "Everyone else is rather defeated I\u2019m afraid. Everyone but the Landlord,
    that is. He couldn\u2019t be happier!"
  branch4:
  - "I\u2019m not sure, sonny. Things have been rather grim for me and... well that's
    no subject for children. Run along, now."
  skipNum: 3
