--- !u!114 &1278100058
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 715907386}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - You there! You're awfully close to my property there, boy!
  - '& 1: Sorry, I didn''t know. 2: Why can''t I be close to it?'
  - No? Well, be more careful! Children like you are what's wrong with this village.
  - '1: Why is that? 2: And what exactly is wrong with the village? ^'
  - Because it's my property! A clumsy child like you would break something.
  - "^ 1: Right.. any idea where a relic could be? 2: What do you think about the
    village\u2019s woes?"
  branch1:
  - "You\u2019re a 4th child, I can see it in your eyes. You are a harbinger of bad
    luck, just as the Shaman says."
  branch2:
  - Foul, blasted luck! All brought about because of you children. The Shaman knew
    it all from the start.
  branch3:
  - Relic? I know not what you mean. There is nothing of the sort in this village,
    how ridiculous.
  branch4:
  - "Woes? Hardly! So much land has been opened up for me. When the Shaman gets us
    out of this mess, I\u2019ll be rich!"
  skipNum: 3
