--- !u!114 &1420681400
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1420681399}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "Aye, littlun, don\u2019t be playin\u2019 too close to this \u2018ere river.
    You kids oughta be more careful. Though, I can\u2019t say I\u2019ve seen ye\u2019
    around\u2026"
  - "& 1: Why? Has something happened by the river before? 2: For a fisherman, you
    don\u2019t seem to have a boat\u2026"
  - "N-no!\u2026 I was just bein\u2019 cautious. Yeah, just bein\u2019 cautious,
    that's all\u2026"
  - "1: You don\u2019t sound sure. 2: The village seems sparse. ^"
  - "Yes, err- I lost it in a flood a \u2018bout year back. I just fish from th\u2019
    bank nowadays."
  - '^ 1: The storms must make it hard to fish. 2: Seen any peculiar objects?'
  branch1:
  - Well- People have drowned in the river before, thats all. Watch yer step.
  branch2:
  - "Not too many people around nowadays... but don\u2019t worry about that sort
    of thing, littlun."
  branch3:
  - Aye, it does. I hardly catch anything these days.
  branch4:
  - Hmm, well I did see something in the merchants house over yonder. Maybe take
    a look there?
  skipNum: 3
