--- !u!114 &1473513739
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1107564745}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "I\u2019ll tell you, my poor neighbor, the farmer, has had some rotten luck,
    but then again so have all of us\u2026"
  - '& 1: What kind of luck? 2: Whereabouts does he live?'
  - The grim kind, my friend. If you ask me it's because of that damn inheritance
    money he stole... &
  - "1: He won\u2019t get rid of it? 2: What kind of item? ^"
  - Just down the way at the end. Be careful not to catch his karma if you go by
    there haha...
  - '^ 1: You said he had bad luck? 2: Karma...?'
  branch1:
  - "No, he simply won\u2019t. He insists it brings him luck, but he\u2019s been
    suffering ever since that kid gave it to him."
  branch2:
  - A jade pendant. An expensive thing, too, I would guess.
  branch3:
  - "Yes, indeed. He\u2019s lost most of his family. He only has his one son now. "
  branch4:
  - "The shaman says karma cannot be caught, but recently I have had doubts. We\u2019ve
    all been afflicted..."
  skipNum: 3
