--- !u!114 &1677007152
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1185011798}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "I wouldn\u2019t go near the Landlord if I were you, little fellow. He is a nasty
    sort."
  - '& 1: Landlord? 2: What''s wrong with him?'
  - Yes, in the big house across from mine.
  - "1: I assume you don\u2019t get along, then? 2: How is he doing with the village
    crisis. ^"
  - "He\u2019s always been a selfish, cruel man. Hit hit my son over the head once."
  - '^ 1: For what? 2: He sounds awful.'
  branch1:
  - "I\u2019m rather indifferent to him, really. Not a nice man in any case, I just
    mind my business."
  branch2:
  - Though he is still far too proud, he is starting to feel the effects, too. The
    famine touches even the wealthy, it seems.
  branch3:
  - He tried to wear a straw hat of his and he slapped him. What could a hat like
    that possibly mean to a rich man such as he?
  branch4:
  - Indeed. He has a disdain for children, so avoid him, will you?
  skipNum: 3
