    - target: {fileID: 5470827515961051326, guid: 7e776ef3bbc21304c9772e3b1a5d62d0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "1: Where\u2019s your big bro? 2: Well, can you at least try being nicer?
        ^"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5470827515961051326, guid: 7e776ef3bbc21304c9772e3b1a5d62d0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5]
      value: "^ 1: Why are you so rude? 2: You don\u2019t have many friends, do you?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5470827515961051326, guid: 7e776ef3bbc21304c9772e3b1a5d62d0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: branch1.Array.data[0]
      value: "He... passed away. That\u2019s none of your business twerp!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5470827515961051326, guid: 7e776ef3bbc21304c9772e3b1a5d62d0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: branch2.Array.data[0]
      value: No way! The strong get there way around here, and niceness would make
        me weak.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5470827515961051326, guid: 7e776ef3bbc21304c9772e3b1a5d62d0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: branch3.Array.data[0]
      value: Dad says I gotta be tough in this world. That means sticking up for
        myself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5470827515961051326, guid: 7e776ef3bbc21304c9772e3b1a5d62d0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: branch4.Array.data[0]
      value: "I don\u2019t need to be friends with anyone! All I need is me!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7049869544066721800, guid: 7e776ef3bbc21304c9772e3b1a5d62d0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Materials.Array.data[0]
